| `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` | string, a credential | unset: `[using default] ANTHROPIC_API_KEY = <hidden>` | an API key | the `claude-code-headless` adapter's child, through `config/project.json` `models.credential_env`; `tests/integration/test_committed_secrets_gate.py` takes the name, never the value, from `scripts/config_loader.py`'s `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` row | Authenticates the model CLI that adapter starts. A value under this name in a file a commit could carry fails the committed-secrets gate. | any other child, which the allowlist never gives it | always |
